  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a comprehensive and integrated programme offer on Governance for Resilient, Inclusive and Sustainable Development in the four SIDS, resting on the core assumption that they will be more resilient to the impacts of climate change and disasters if countries manage their development (plans, policies, priorities, finances) and associated governance processes through a risk informed approach.</narrative>
  </description>
